# Templates

Layout: `templates/{id}/template.html` + `contract.json` (both required). Root from `Rendering:TemplatesRoot`.

## Authoring

- `<body class="pf-document">`. Shared print CSS is injected at render time - do not `<link>` stylesheets (PeachPDF will not load them).
- Document-specific CSS only in a `<style>` block in `template.html`.
- Prefer `{{ name }}` for values; strings from `data` are HTML-escaped before Scriban.
- `contract.json`: JSON Schema draft 2020-12; prefer `additionalProperties: false` and explicit `required`.

## Code path (do not re-explore)

`Core/Inputs/TemplateStore.Load` -> `TemplateDataValidator.Validate` -> `ScribanTemplateRenderer.Render` -> `PrintBaselineInjector` -> optional `HtmlToPdfRenderer`.

Sample: `src/OxyKit.Render.Api/templates/invoice/`. Path traversal / unknown ids already rejected in `TemplateStore`.
